7 |     let _ = AtomicU64::new(0).swap(1, StoreStore);
  |                               ----    ^^^^^^^^^^ a read-modify-write takes `Relaxed`, `Acquire`, `Release`, `AcqRel` or `SeqCst` from `atomix::ordering`
